      "text": "`engos-delivery-artifact-embed` skill only after the bundle has passed this"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "## Required Output"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "289f47924cf7669901e5ac323dec5cd9a29eb26cbeba396597e8b61dfc36f6b8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "must not mutate the reviewed source inventory. The Markdown tables must include at least:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d1a96beb5b94ac57063c07c91061969729b8a9228c7024e542fb0b30593bd138",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "| Required table | Minimum columns |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2dd27ab8ca83c4057e71c58e45c897bb2d510adc2c95ecbf736f35c99cee0678",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "| API / contracts | Method, endpoint (network only), purpose, direction, interface, producer, consumer, contract state, evidence, owner/action |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "de03f385e6beb1789c8306668bafaf81d84c4b493c86ecc112acfea4f889bf32",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "Each diagram source must have a caption, diagram type, evidence references, and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "770880d8b8f51430d356c78492079faa127fb37f800d2587b0a355d858b1e9d3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "1. Read the pitch and evidence ledger before drawing. Extract only components,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "615a1acbad36edd29859ecdaf8ea58e2a121cc27355e576092ab7331bab2d060",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "that covers the required seams; if the source cannot support a diagram,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b84887955cf475a536a511dcf08cfff38e7d520cf0de66b9977186fac816c9f4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "4. Author the contract table for both provided and required interfaces. Record"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b2c405ae372f77fd4c536f94afe969b805f4925d9e5f51dedc0a99ff0a848048",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "5. Author the security-owner matrix. Assign responsibility only when the pitch"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9c0891e45ac11c8dd48c55034a6f0c41becb1d90f2e96d48502c2cc2505617dd",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "8. Return the bundle and a short judgment. Do not place it on a Google Doc,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ca72a2af1ebae6f3f68c8790f21881843892b3c687b02d54323dfb63a83fe924",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "use SVG-to-PNG only when the target surface cannot accept Mermaid or SVG and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "186400690de02716671138281f6baa35fcb46e2c31ffea8a1376dddc83649ff8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "- Never invent methods, classes, endpoints, internal algorithms, retries,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1a4566c7955e8c3f27fd5aeb0c1e21bd6505b473f2fcc52c708ed27f79a0e6b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "- A diagram is not complete merely because it parses. It must cover the named"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "41acc42318df7524dbf49873e78bfef1d5b0314205a97511823f6a4545424965",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "- Treat an unresolved rabbit hole as a mitigation or blocker, never as a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d16090ea15c3ccd3854f803bf90d7563cbdf7fda3a59422a61a718fbb3474654",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "- Contracts and interfaces only; do not produce implementation code or Jira"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "55ee342d593d7a6e0ac677d63972b29150629a739325e3863f4b0df73793d0be",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "place an image, but they must retain a link or hash to the source bundle and"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "30beea8c5094a61ac9833a0bffb1e6be440671bde2b0a36adcedb3e4958283f2",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "must report placement evidence separately."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0631f727847900799ea0a724c034bbac2e58b933476ef79b896b1292482d4d68",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "- It must work from pasted content, a local file, or a read-only source export."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1b8335e57c127b3caa8fbc30540e2507c78232a375ca4cd91f82e63b2348bb3e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "never return a polished but unsupported diagram."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c06f32ebed1a3f6494eb842e264892baacdf21709a4db708df73e24729227630",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "> the component and request flow visible, list provided and required"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4caf107c3c8307cba5d06ccde8e8761b456390035fc92ee18ca20ab1767fca2e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "| Contract completeness | Provided/required interfaces have state, owner/action, and evidence |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4b1a79e106154c65883ee0b8095d76ace0a04fe0dc024ae2f36b4c9dd4ad590e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "Stage 3 authoring; direct artifact requests can remain artifact-only with upstream"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2c96789dff12f489bfdce38e988131e99bdea15fadd8d4bb8e716a98f33225e7",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts.md",
      "text": "placement occurs only after full-run G3 passes. Return complete row/diagram inventory,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e3b8cda6b6547d8583be884a1f5376f244a8382ab4d62448e9ce9acaf0466b0a",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/diagram-style.md",
      "text": "proposal accompanies every node, edge and control; never invent component internals."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ebb5ee5bdf465570e82fbd8614e17faacb1aa6d31a80f49868bc2c5f2196e873",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/diagram-style.md",
      "text": "complete coverage; do not shrink important labels into unreadability."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9c035ebdbf6ff83a0dab8a91266dd8d9da19e151e661fbfe75c7db43f07ac62e",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/diagram-style.md",
      "text": "selectors must be verified against rendered pixels; syntactically accepted styling"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "20e9d759279a2c58cea090726804fdf8b059f7aceece9ef493b6d25c8711e7fb",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/diagram-style.md",
      "text": "prohibitions. Never count parser success alone as visual validation."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e74c90cecf126e4a68fb6421b2149f1f73e2271ee1ef53bc802f2e24ceeebc5a",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/bundle.md",
      "text": "# Required shaping bundle"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "fed5089db1f34bb9bebc44f3c319790bb03c74a48a3399620489396ac62b31cb",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/bundle.md",
      "text": "snapshots before authoring. Artifact-only mode may use a supplied solution but"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "801fd3ef810ee47a7a0fed20dc58d694619bc036949c0741d6026aa5c3ec81a1",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/bundle.md",
      "text": "must not fabricate upstream gate history. Annotate existing/proposed/unknown seams."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "65a198124406358e2bd144cfb8e652e3cc01f25250e706238691f4ccd4fe2414",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/bundle.md",
      "text": "For standalone artifact-only requests, use the supplied solution and produce only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "629f831d8edd758ca8b10933563c128a9beb3af65a69c70236c7fd31689d3cf4",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-diagram-contract-artifacts/references/bundle.md",
      "text": "shaping sidecar is required. Retain partial/blocked results when evidence is missing."
